[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0020","text":"（我也困……但负责敲木鱼的人要是打瞌睡\n　就说不过去了……忍住……忍住……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0030","text":"（……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0040","text":"（…………）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0050","text":"（集中……！放空……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0060","text":"（…………\n　什么都不想，到底该怎么做来着……！？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0070","text":"（──啊不行……！\n　越是告诉自己别想就越在想……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0080","text":"（………………）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0090","text":"（不能睡……\n　忍住……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0100","text":"（不……果然好困……\n　……糟糕……要打哈欠——）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0110","text":"（呜……呜呜……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0120","text":"（脚……麻了……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0130","text":"（换个坐姿是不是不行啊……\n　…………麻酥酥的——）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0140","text":"（让心静下来，集中……集中……\n　这样我的不安也会消除的！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0150","text":"（……咦？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0160","text":"（现在完全没有不安呢！\n　算了，总之享受坐禅——）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0170","text":"结束！\n可以放松了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0180","text":"～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0190","text":"凛世，你的专注力真厉害"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_04_0200","text":"……制作人大人您……\n看起来好困……"}]
